    "title": "John Deere Events",
    "description": "John Deere Events is your gateway to a better experience at John Deere trade show exhibits, special events and other programs. Inside, you\u2019ll find access to multiple event-specific apps with always up-to-date schedules, display lists, references, and much, much more.\r\n\r\nInformation at your fingertips includes:\r\n-          Basic event details\r\n-          Maps of exhibits for efficient navigation\r\n-          Special presentation, class and demonstration schedules\r\n-          More in-depth details on equipment and solutions on display\r\n-          Useful links to related resources",
